{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to race your friends through a collapsing city, grind across lava bridges, or pull backflips over exploding cars \u2014 all while dropping traps behind you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to BREAKING DECK</strong> \u2014 a <strong>3D skateboarding PvP race party game</strong> where every map is a new kind of madness. Race, perform tricks, sabotage your friends, and survive the chaos long enough to cross the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win with style, you\u2019re a legend. If you crash spectacularly \u2014 at least you looked cool doing it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae RACE WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across wild tracks in crazy settings \u2014 rooftops, factories, deserts, frozen highways, and more.<br>Grind, flip, and boost your way to victory while recording your best trick combos to climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/6d4fec83e144527719971ca04371ebef.poster.avif?t=1767602152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/6d4fec83e144527719971ca04371ebef.webm?t=1767602152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/6d4fec83e144527719971ca04371ebef.mp4?t=1767602152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf1 BUILD THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add ramps, rails, and traps mid-race to mess with everyone else.<br>Drop fans, swinging hammers, or falling platforms to send your friends flying.<br>Each run becomes unpredictable \u2014 no two races ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/20f6068c495e3412bad5870eabab2069.poster.avif?t=1767602152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/20f6068c495e3412bad5870eabab2069.webm?t=1767602152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/20f6068c495e3412bad5870eabab2069.mp4?t=1767602152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D PvP Skateboarding Races</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique maps &amp; biomes</strong> with dynamic obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick-based scoring system</strong> \u2014 the better you ride, the faster you boost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build-as-you-play traps</strong> to sabotage opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online  multiplayer</strong> for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay system</strong> to flex your most ridiculous runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable skaters &amp; boards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/93eb3b78be553d4c2bbc3718210b4899.poster.avif?t=1767602152\" width=584 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/93eb3b78be553d4c2bbc3718210b4899.webm?t=1767602152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/93eb3b78be553d4c2bbc3718210b4899.mp4?t=1767602152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677590?t=1767602152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/c0a734854b8ab1343297f6d2999515bf7dce4411/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767602152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/6f24c298644aceb2a6d145f30a7a40f21e07d7d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767602152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/6f24c298644aceb2a6d145f30a7a40f21e07d7d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767602152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to race your friends through a collapsing city, grind across lava bridges, or pull backflips over exploding cars \u2014 all while dropping traps behind you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to BREAKING DECK</strong> \u2014 a <strong>3D skateboarding PvP race party game</strong> where every map is a new kind of madness. Race, perform tricks, sabotage your friends, and survive the chaos long enough to cross the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win with style, y